#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Recommended API: Mistral OCR with structured document annotations.

It handles native PDFs and scans, supports English/Italian, and extracts only
the requested fields without purchasing a full invoice-processing workflow.

Install:
    pip install httpx pypdf

Run:
