Batch invoice extraction using Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite on Vertex AI.

Why this choice:
- Handles digital PDFs and scanned PDFs directly.
- English and Italian are supported.
- Structured JSON output avoids paying for full invoice-processing products.
- Vertex AI Batch is suitable for overnight processing and receives batch pricing.
- At 1.2M pages, estimated model cost is normally far below the $4,800 budget.
  Verify current Vertex AI pricing before deployment.

Requirements:
    pip install google-genai google-cloud-storage

Authentication:
    gcloud auth application-default login
    export GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT="your-project"

Example:
    python invoice_batch.py \
        --input gs://invoice-bucket/monthly/2026-01/ \
        --work gs://invoice-bucket/gemini-jobs/2026-01/ \
        --output gs://invoice-bucket/extracted/2026-01.jsonl \
        --expected-pages 1200000

The output is JSONL:
    {
      "source_uri": "gs://.../invoice.pdf",
      "supplier_id": "IT12345678901",
      "invoice_date": "2026-01-15",
      "currency": "EUR",
